    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17553" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">faecŭla</span></b>  (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fēcŭla</span></b> , and contracted <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">faecla</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Cael. Aur.
